@startuml
!theme plain
title OpenData documentation authority and release closure
rectangle "Source + executed evidence" as Source
rectangle "Release readiness and architecture" as Current
rectangle "User / operations / developer / reference" as Guides
rectangle "Accepted ADRs" as ADR
rectangle "Historical reviews and releases" as History
Source -down-> Current : authoritative behaviour
Current -down-> Guides : current guidance
Guides -down-> ADR : design context
ADR -down-> History : historical context
note right of Source
Documentation programme complete.
Production release still requires
source remediation and target tests.
end note
@enduml
